has numbers with Length is 4
constant Identity = Quaternion(0, 0, 0, 1)
constant HalfTurn = Quaternion(0, 0, 1, 0)
X Number
	Quaternion(1, 2, 3, 4).X is 1
	numbers.X
Y Number
	Quaternion(1, 2, 3, 4).Y is 2
	numbers.Y
Z Number
	Quaternion(1, 2, 3, 4).Z is 3
	numbers.Z
W Number
	Quaternion(1, 2, 3, 4).W is 4
	numbers.W
Dot(other) Number
	Identity.Dot(HalfTurn) is 0
	X * other.X + Y * other.Y + Z * other.Z + W * other.W
Normalize Quaternion
	Quaternion(0, 0, 0, 2).Normalize is Identity
	Quaternion(numbers / Dot(value).SquareRoot)
Lerp(other, alpha Number) Quaternion
	Identity.Lerp(Quaternion(0, 0, 0, -1), 0.5) is Identity
	Identity.Lerp(HalfTurn, 1) is HalfTurn
	Quaternion(Blended(other, Dot(other) < 0 then -1 else 1, alpha)).Normalize
Blended(other Quaternion, sign Number, alpha Number) Numbers
	Identity.Blended(HalfTurn, 1, 0.5) is (0, 0, 0.5, 0.5)
	for 4
		numbers(index) + (other.numbers(index) * sign - numbers(index)) * alpha
Rotation Matrix
	Identity.Rotation is Matrix.Identity
	HalfTurn.Rotation.Transformed(Vector3.UnitX) is Vector3(-1, 0, 0)
	let first = (1 - 2 * (Y * Y + Z * Z), 2 * (X * Y + W * Z), 2 * (X * Z - W * Y), 0)
	let second = (2 * (X * Y - W * Z), 1 - 2 * (X * X + Z * Z), 2 * (Y * Z + W * X), 0)
	let third = (2 * (X * Z + W * Y), 2 * (Y * Z - W * X), 1 - 2 * (X * X + Y * Y), 0)
	Matrix(first + second + third + (0, 0, 0, 1))